41" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>1. 개요</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>시민 제안 및 민원 데이터를 기반으로</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
공공청사, 도서관, 체육시설 등에서의 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>불편 사항</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>을 분석하였으며,</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
