out="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>2. 주요 시민 요구사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>냉난방 온도 조절권 제공 요청</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>2. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>의자 및 테이블 수량 부족 문제</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>3. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>여성 화장실 대기 시간 감소 방안</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>4. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>아동 놀이공간 접근성 개선</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>5. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>휴게공간 내 와이파이 불안정 이슈</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="39962" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅲ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMar