</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>일부 공간은 천장이 낮아 체감 소음이 큼
민원인의 이동 동선과 휴게 공간 간 동선이 교차함</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="None" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978310" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="2"><SIZE Height="2263" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="19590" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="true" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="9" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="2250"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>2</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="10" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="563"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="11" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2263" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="16777"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="27" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="14"><CHAR>3.2 도서관</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>콘센트 부족</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>전등 밝기 조절 불가 (특히 열람실 내부)</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>도서관 내 냉방 강도 조절 민원이 매월 15건 이상 발생
